   "text": "3a  Research Planner  (smart)\n\nBreaks the question into 3–5 sub-questions:\nspecific, answerable from sources, no overlap\n(definitions, mechanisms, evidence,\ncomparisons, limitations, current state)\n\nFails? → research the question as a whole",
   "originalText": "3a  Research Planner  (smart)\n\nBreaks the question into 3–5 sub-questions:\nspecific, answerable from sources, no overlap\n(definitions, mechanisms, evidence,\ncomparisons, limitations, current state)\n\nFails? → research the question as a whole",
