   "text": "3b  Context Manager  (no LLM)\n\nThis thread: last 3 reports\n\nThis user's other threads:\n  BM25 keyword rank (score > 2)\n  + LanceDB meaning search\n  → fuse() with RRF  → top 2 reports\n\nPrivate documents uploaded to this thread\n\nRe-uses the best 5 old evidence chunks\nas sourceType \"memory\"",
