   "text": "Loop pass  (coverageStatus = \"missing\")\n\n• reads the Coverage Evaluator's gapAnalysis\n• sees the last 30 queries already tried\n• writes 1–4 NEW queries for the gaps only\n• drops any query already in queryHistory",
   "originalText": "Loop pass  (coverageStatus = \"missing\")\n\n• reads the Coverage Evaluator's gapAnalysis\n• sees the last 30 queries already tried\n• writes 1–4 NEW queries for the gaps only\n• drops any query already in queryHistory",
