   "text": "If the model fails: the sub-questions themselves are used as the queries, so the pipeline keeps moving.\nOutput → pendingQueries (replaced each pass) and queryHistory (appended, never forgets).",
   "originalText": "If the model fails: the sub-questions themselves are used as the queries, so the pipeline keeps moving.\nOutput → pendingQueries (replaced each pass) and queryHistory (appended, never forgets).",
