   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why the cap is checked first\nA loop that asks \"enough yet?\" can say no\nforever. MAX_RESEARCH_ITERATIONS = 2 means\nat most 3 search passes. Hitting it is\nwritten into the report, never hidden.",
