   "text": "finalReport  =  report text   +   ## Sources   +   ## Research notes\n\n[3] Title (link) — host · found via tavily, retrieved 2026-10-08 · quote\nprivate documents → \"(private document)\" · memory → \"(from prior research)\"\nResearch notes: claims it couldn't trace + every limitation hit during the run",
   "originalText": "finalReport  =  report text   +   ## Sources   +   ## Research notes\n\n[3] Title (link) — host · found via tavily, retrieved 2026-10-08 · quote\nprivate documents → \"(private document)\" · memory → \"(from prior research)\"\nResearch notes: claims it couldn't trace + every limitation hit during the run",
