   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The model writes text and [n] numbers. Code writes every URL.\nSo a source in the list always exists in the evidence store: the model has no way to invent a link.\nAlso returns citationReport: claims checked, unsupported, invalid numbers removed, numbers cited.",
   "originalText": "The model writes text and [n] numbers. Code writes every URL.\nSo a source in the list always exists in the evidence store: the model has no way to invent a link.\nAlso returns citationReport: claims checked, unsupported, invalid numbers removed, numbers cited.",
