   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "How it works\nA scripted fake model replaces every LLM call\n(callStructured / callText check a test hook first).\nNo API keys. Search is pointed at DuckDuckGo with\na 3 s timeout, so network failures are EXPECTED.\nA private document gives it real evidence.",
   "originalText": "How it works\nA scripted fake model replaces every LLM call\n(callStructured / callText check a test hook first).\nNo API keys. Search is pointed at DuckDuckGo with\na 3 s timeout, so network failures are EXPECTED.\nA private document gives it real evidence.",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "f13_how",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 17
  },
