   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Four runs\n1  normal: coverage says \"missing\" once,\n   the critic asks for one revision\n2  never satisfied: both caps must stop it\n3  off-topic question: LLM guardrail blocks\n4  jailbreak + gibberish: quick checks block",
   "originalText": "Four runs\n1  normal: coverage says \"missing\" once,\n   the critic asks for one revision\n2  never satisfied: both caps must stop it\n3  off-topic question: LLM guardrail blocks\n4  jailbreak + gibberish: quick checks block",
